abstract: >-
  Scaffold release (v0.1.0): public repository for studying iterative
  oracle-guided repair of LLM-generated finite state machines. This tag
  documents project scope, metadata, and reproducibility policy only; it
  does not include frozen campaigns or empirical repair outcomes. Companion
  EMSE manuscript sources are maintained separately.
